  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialCOntroller
  texts:
  - 1The train is your only way to get through the road, you gotta protect it
  - 2This dial shows the remaining fuel
  - "3Make sure you don\u2019t run out of it, otherwise the machine will explode"
  - 4Try replenishing the fuel
  - 5Try replenishing the fuel
  - 6Your fuel has been replenished but you ran out of reserves
  - "7Some enemies will drop coal when they\u2019re killed"
  - "8Some enemies will drop coal when they\u2019re killed"
  - 9However, others will be more hostile
  - "10Damage to the hull will determine your maximun fuel capacity and it can\u2019t
    be restored until you reach a station"
  - 11Fortunately, your shield will prevent you from taking damage and it will regenerate
    after a few seconds
  - 12Fortunately, your shield will prevent you from taking damage and it will regenerate
    after a few seconds
  - 13Defeated enemies will drop gold and it will be deposited in the gold wagon
  - 14
  - "15You won\u2019t be able to hold gold as long as the wagon is broken, try fixing
    it."
  - 16
  - 17Your gold is still not safe, you must take it to the vault to reclaim it
  - 18
  - 19You can use the stored gold to buy new wagons and weapons in the stations
  - "20Now you\u2019re ready to take on the road!"
